    "body": "I guess it should be \"must\", since this is a normative authoring conformance requirement? \"has to\" is not really correct since authors don't have to do what we tell them. I guess \"must\" is a bit dubious from that perspective too.\n\nMaybe \"will if it is conformant\".\n",
